WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.320
Trump and the thuggery that his agents have brought

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:06.500
has actively made us less safe.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.280
The state of Illinois is going to use every lever

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.080
at our disposal to resist this power grab

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:15.360
and get gnomes, thugs, the hell out of Chicago.

